\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs20\cf17\insrsid2451147\charrsid1005749 The linac model code. Default is \\linac=6 which corresponds to a Varian Clinac}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs20\cf17\insrsid11617927\charrsid1005749 
